<concept id="git-addon-manage-branches-tags-and-history">
  <title>Manage Branches, Tags, and History</title>
  
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>branches</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>tags</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>history</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <conbody>
    <p id="p_git_branches_tags_history_overview">Use these tools when you need to switch branches, create branches or tags, inspect previous commits, or find who changed a resource. The <uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol> and <uicontrol>Git History</uicontrol> views provide most branch and history actions.</p>
  </conbody>
